@startuml
title Admin User - Reset Password (PUT /api/admin/users/{userId}/reset-password)
hide footbox
actor Client
participant UserController
participant AppUserService
participant AppUserRepository
participant PasswordEncoder
participant GlobalExceptionHandler as GEH

Client -> UserController: PUT /api/admin/users/{userId}/reset-password {newPassword}
note right of Client: Already authenticated by JwtAuthenticationFilter\nSecurityConfig: /api/admin/** requires role ADMIN

alt Request body fails @Valid (newPassword blank or shorter than 6)
    UserController --> GEH: MethodArgumentNotValidException
    GEH --> Client: 400 Bad Request (field errors)
else Request body is valid
    UserController -> AppUserService: resetPassword(userId, request)

    AppUserService -> AppUserService: findUserOrThrow(userId)
    AppUserService -> AppUserRepository: findById(userId)
    AppUserRepository --> AppUserService: Optional<AppUser>

    alt Optional is empty (user not found)
        AppUserService --> UserController: throw ResourceNotFoundException
        UserController --> GEH: ResourceNotFoundException
        GEH --> Client: 404 Not Found
    else User found
        AppUserService -> PasswordEncoder: encode(request.getNewPassword())
        PasswordEncoder --> AppUserService: encoded password
        AppUserService -> AppUserService: user.setPassword(encodedPassword)
        AppUserService -> AppUserRepository: save(user)
        AppUserRepository --> AppUserService: saved AppUser
        AppUserService --> UserController: void
        UserController --> Client: 204 No Content
    end
end
@enduml